  "updated_at": "2026-03-19",
  "bio": "João Diogo Sardinha is a masterful tattoo artist based in Lisbon, Portugal, specializing in the unique and expressive 'sketch' style. Their work exhibits a high level of skill, each piece a testament to their artistry and dedication to the craft. Clients praise João for maintaining an impressive standard of cleanliness in their operations at Domus Tattoo Art, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lisbon, Portugal"
}